# Chipsec CPython profile.
# Disable list (makesetup "first rule wins"); intersection across profiles:
# a capability is enabled when any selected profile omits its disable.
# _hashlib is intentionally omitted so hashlib gets its OpenSSL backend;
# modules/chipsec owns CONFIG_OPENSSL and chipsec_cpython_depends=openssl.
# _uuid, bz2, lzma and readline stay disabled (traced but optional paths).
*disabled*
_ctypes
_gdbm
_sqlite3
_ssl
_tkinter
_uuid
bz2
curses
dbm
lzma
nis
readline
